{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20055",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.28,
      "end_seconds": 5.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Right then, come on in. Okay, where shall we begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 6.75,
      "end_seconds": 15.93,
      "duration_seconds": 9.18,
      "text": "Yeah, I've been dealing with itching especially at night. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.61,
      "end_seconds": 24.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.98,
      "end_seconds": 30.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Let me think, it's been six months now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.21,
      "end_seconds": 40.6,
      "duration_seconds": 9.39,
      "text": "Right, can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.44,
      "end_seconds": 44.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Mild, really. Warmth definitely sets it off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.21,
      "end_seconds": 50.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "A few quick ones: new medicines or rash on the face?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.34,
      "end_seconds": 55.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "No, you know, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.72,
      "end_seconds": 59.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Any oozing or swollen glands?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.08,
      "end_seconds": 62.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.91,
      "end_seconds": 66.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.52,
      "end_seconds": 71.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "My heart's been fine, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.96,
      "end_seconds": 80.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.83,
      "end_seconds": 84.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "No, not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.25,
      "end_seconds": 94.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Any regular medication at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.23,
      "end_seconds": 98.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "No, nothing at the moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.37,
      "end_seconds": 112.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.15,
      "end_seconds": 118.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.35,
      "end_seconds": 120.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.46,
      "end_seconds": 126.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.24,
      "end_seconds": 129.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.16,
      "end_seconds": 133.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.47,
      "end_seconds": 136.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.28,
      "end_seconds": 141.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.15,
      "end_seconds": 157.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.02,
      "end_seconds": 162.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "No surgery, um, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.4,
      "end_seconds": 182.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.22,
      "end_seconds": 185.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Not really, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.51,
      "end_seconds": 192.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "Okay, I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.46,
      "end_seconds": 194.16,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.85,
      "end_seconds": 197.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.62,
      "end_seconds": 220.24,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "There are small burrow-like tracks and red bumps between the fingers and on the wrists, with scratch marks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.04,
      "end_seconds": 234.83,
      "duration_seconds": 8.79,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. From what you've told me and what I found, it fits best with scabies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.75,
      "end_seconds": 241.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.84,
      "end_seconds": 278.57,
      "duration_seconds": 35.73,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's scabies, and we'll watch how it goes. I'm going to put you on permethrin cream, 5 percent, once, then again after a week, for two weeks. That should help with scabies. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well. Everyone at home should be treated at the same time, and wash bedding and clothes at a high temperature."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.13,
      "end_seconds": 304.29,
      "duration_seconds": 25.16,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. If you smoke, this is a good moment to think about stopping, and we can help you with that. Come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse. Let's plan a check in two weeks. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.32,
      "end_seconds": 307.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    }
  ]
}